rk, so it needs ai_config:write.</p></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-v0rz6p"><button class="MuiButtonBase-root Mui-disabled MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary css-74d805-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiButton-root" tabindex="-1" type="submit" disabled="">Save changes</button><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 css-7ctihp-MuiTypography-root">Saves the switches, the policy, the defaults, the limits and each provider's settings. Keys are saved separately, on each provider.</p></div></form></div></div>"`;

exports[`the AI pages' markup is unchanged > the AI configuration page, writable 1`] = `"<div class="MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthLg css-5c1adp-MuiContainer-root"><div class="MuiBox-root css-8f57v9"><h1 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h4 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1it4a80-MuiTypography-root">AI</h1><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-9ebprp-MuiTypography-root">Switch AI on for this deployment, choose whose keys pay for calls, and configure each provider.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 css-1tty75b-MuiTypography-root">Last updated by admin@example.com on <date></p><form class="MuiBox-root css-0" novalidate=""><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 css-srvwji-MuiPaper-root" style="--Paper-shadow: 0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);"><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEnd css-19opgx6-MuiFormControlLabel-root"><span class="MuiSwitch-root MuiSwitch-sizeMedium css-rehya9-MuiSwitch-root"><span class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary Mui-checked PrivateSwitchBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary Mui-checked Mui-checked css-aqlqb4-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiSwitchBase-root-MuiSwitch-switchBase"><input role="switch" aria-label="Enable AI for this deployment" class="PrivateSwitchBase-input MuiSwitch-input css-12xagqm-MuiSwitchBase-root" type="checkbox" checked=""><span class="MuiSwitch-thumb css-1mw77bv-MuiSwitch-thumb"></span></span><span class="MuiSwitch-track css-pm6g3f-MuiSwitch-track"></span></span><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 MuiFormControlLabel-label css-rizt0-MuiTypography-root">Enable AI for this deployment</span></label><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root css-r9aic6-MuiFormHelperText-root">The kill switch. Turning it off stops every AI feature at once, without touching keys or models.</p><hr class="MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth css-1ouqunm-MuiDivider-root"><div class="MuiFormControl-root css-1iw3t7y-MuiFormControl-root"><label class="MuiFormLabel-root MuiFormLabel-colorPrimary css-nwsdb5-MuiFormLabel-root" id="ai-key-policy-label">Whose key pays for a call</label><div class="MuiFormGroup-root MuiRadioGroup-root css-1mac7pt-MuiFormGroup-root" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="ai-key-policy-label"><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEnd css-19opgx6-MuiFormControlLabel-root"><span class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiRadio-root MuiRadio-colorPrimary PrivateSwitchBase-root MuiRadio-root MuiRadio-colorPrimary Mui-checked MuiRadio-root MuiRadio-colorPrimary css-1q72ply-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiSwitchBase-root-MuiRadio-root"><input class="PrivateSwitchBase-input css-12xagqm-MuiSwitchBase-root" type="radio" value="byok" checked="" name="_rX_"><span class="css-9oxshb-MuiRadioButtonIcon-root"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium css-iy8fvg-MuiSvgIcon-root-MuiRadioButtonIcon-root" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="RadioButtonUncheckedIcon"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm0 18c-4.42 0-8-3.58-8-8s3.58-8 8-8 8 3.58 8 8-3.58 8-8 8z"></path></svg><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium css-1pqw2bl-MuiSvgIcon-root-MuiRadioButtonIcon-root" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="RadioButtonCheckedIcon"><path d="M8.465 8.465C9.37 7.56 10.62 7 12 7C14.76 7 17 9.24 17 12C17 13.38 16.44 14.63 15.535 15.535C14.63 16.44 13.38 17 12 17C9.24 17 7 14.76 7 12C7 10.62 7.56 9.37 8.465 8.465Z"></path></svg></span></span><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 MuiFormControlLabel-label css-rizt0-MuiTypography-root">Users bring their own key (recommended)</span></label><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEnd css-19opgx6-MuiFormControlLabel-root"><span class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiRadio-root MuiRadio-colorPrimary PrivateSwitchBase-root MuiRadio-root MuiRadio-colorPrimary MuiRadio-root MuiRadio-colorPrimary css-1q72ply-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiSwitchBase-root-MuiRadio-root"><input class="PrivateSwitchBase-input css-12xagqm-MuiSwitchBase-root" type="radio" value="byok_with_org_fallback" name="_rX_"><span class="css-9oxshb-MuiRadioButtonIcon-root"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium css-iy8fvg-MuiSvgIcon-root-MuiRadioButtonIcon-root" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="RadioButtonUncheckedIcon"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm0 18c-4.42 0-8-3.58-8-8s3.58-8 8-8 8 3.58 8 8-3.58 8-8 8z"></path></svg><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium css-cpa8b4-MuiSvgIcon-root-MuiRadioButtonIcon-root" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="RadioButtonCheckedIcon"><path d="M8.465 8.465C9.37 7.56 10.62 7 12 7C14.76 7 17 9.24 17 12C17 13.38 16.44 14.63 15.535 15.535C14.63 16.44 13.38 17 12 17C9.24 17 7 14.76 7 12C7 10.62 7.56 9.37 8.465 8.465Z"></path></svg></span></span><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 MuiFormControlLabel-label css-rizt0-MuiTypography-root">Users bring their own key; fall back to the organization key</span></label></div><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root MuiFormHelperText-sizeMedium MuiFormHelperText-contained css-er619e-MuiFormHelperText-root">The organization key below is always used to discover models. This choice decides whether it also pays for users' calls.</p></div><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEnd css-1j54jri-MuiFormControlLabel-root"><span class="MuiSwitch-root MuiSwitch-sizeMedium css-rehya9-MuiSwitch-root"><span class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary Mui-checked PrivateSwitchBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary Mui-checked Mui-checked css-aqlqb4-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiSwitchBase-root-MuiSwitch-switchBase"><input role="switch" aria-label="Deployment keys serve organizations" class="PrivateSwitchBase-input MuiSwitch-input css-12xagqm-MuiSwitchBase-root" type="checkbox" checked=""><span class="MuiSwitch-thumb css-1mw77bv-MuiSwitch-thumb"></span></span><span class="MuiSwitch-track css-pm6g3f-MuiSwitch-track"></span></span><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 MuiFormControlLabel-label css-rizt0-MuiTypography-root">Deployment keys serve organizations</span></label><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root css-r9aic6-MuiFormHelperText-root">On: an organization without its own key uses the keys stored below. Off: each organization must store its own key on its Organization AI keys page.</p><hr class="MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth css-1ouqunm-MuiDivider-root"><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEnd css-19opgx6-MuiFormControlLabel-root"><span class="MuiSwitch-root MuiSwitch-sizeMedium css-rehya9-MuiSwitch-root"><span class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary PrivateSwitchBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary css-aqlqb4-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiSwitchBase-root-MuiSwitch-switchBase"><input role="switch" aria-label="Log prompt content" class="PrivateSwitchBase-input MuiSwitch-input css-12xagqm-MuiSwitchBase-root" type="checkbox"><span class="MuiSwitch-thumb css-1mw77bv-MuiSwitch-thumb"></span></span><span class="MuiSwitch-track css-pm6g3f-MuiSwitch-track"></span></span><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 MuiFormControlLabel-label css-rizt0-MuiTypography-root">Log prompt content</span></label><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root css-r9aic6-MuiFormHelperText-root">Off by default. Usage is always recorded; this adds what users actually typed.</p><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h6 css-ods1y1-MuiTypography-root">Defaults</h2><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-spacing-xs-2 css-mwb7rv-MuiGrid-root"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-sm-6 css-13xb3fr-MuiGrid-root"><div class="MuiFormControl-root MuiFormControl-fullWidth MuiTextField-root css-cmpglg-MuiFormControl-root-MuiTextField-root"><label class="MuiFormLabel-root MuiInputLabel-root MuiInputLabel-formControl MuiInputLabel-animated MuiInputLabel-shrink MuiInputLabel-outlined MuiFormLabel-colorPrimary MuiFormLabel-filled MuiInputLabel-root MuiInputLabel-formControl MuiInputLabel-animated MuiInputLabel-shrink MuiInputLabel-outlined css-113d811-MuiFormLabel-root-MuiInputLabel-root" data-shrink="true" for="_rX_" id="_rX_-label">Maximum output tokens per call</label><div class="MuiInputBase-root MuiOutlinedInput-root MuiInputBase-colorPrimary MuiInputBase-fullWidth MuiInputBase-formControl css-1blp12k-MuiInputBase-root-MuiOutlinedInput-root"><input aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="_rX_-helper-text" id="_rX_" inputmode="numeric" class="MuiInputBase-input MuiOutlinedInput-input css-16wblaj-MuiInputBase-input-MuiOutlinedInput-input" type="text" value="4096"><fieldset aria-hidden="true" class="MuiOutlinedInput-notchedOutline css-18p5xg2-MuiNotchedOutlined-root-MuiOutlinedInput-notchedOutline"><legend class="css-ex8a5f-MuiNotchedOutlined-root"><span>Maximum output tokens per call</span></legend></fieldset></div><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root MuiFormHelperText-sizeMedium MuiFormHelperText-contained MuiFormHelperText-filled css-er619e-MuiFormHelperText-root" id="_rX_-helper-text">A ceiling applied to every request. Leave blank for no cap.</p></div></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-sm-6 css-13xb3fr-MuiGrid-root"><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEnd css-19opgx6-MuiFormControlLabel-root"><span class="MuiSwitch-root MuiSwitch-sizeMedium css-rehya9-MuiSwitch-root"><span class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary Mui-checked PrivateSwitchBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary Mui-checked Mui-checked css-aqlqb4-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiSwitchBase-root-MuiSwitch-switchBase"><input role="switch" aria-label="Allow background runs" class="PrivateSwitchBase-input MuiSwitch-input css-12xagqm-MuiSwitchBase-root" type="checkbox" checked=""><span class="MuiSwitch-thumb css-1mw77bv-MuiSwitch-thumb"></span></span><span class="MuiSwitch-track css-pm6g3f-MuiSwitch-track"></span></span><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 MuiFormControlLabel-label css-rizt0-MuiTypography-root">Allow background runs</span></label><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root css-r9aic6-MuiFormHelperText-root">Long requests run on the job queue instead of holding a connection open.</p></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-sm-6 css-13xb3fr-MuiGrid-root"><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEnd css-19opgx6-MuiFormControlLabel-root"><span class="MuiSwitch-root MuiSwitch-sizeMedium css-rehya9-MuiSwitch-root"><span class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary PrivateSwitchBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary css-aqlqb4-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiSwitchBase-root-MuiSwitch-switchBase"><input role="switch" aria-label="Allow realtime voice sessions" class="PrivateSwitchBase-input MuiSwitch-input css-12xagqm-MuiSwitchBase-root" type="checkbox"><span class="MuiSwitch-thumb css-1mw77bv-MuiSwitch-thumb"></span></span><span class="MuiSwitch-track css-pm6g3f-MuiSwitch-track"></span></span><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 MuiFormControlLabel-label css-rizt0-MuiTypography-root">Allow realtime voice sessions</span></label><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root css-r9aic6-MuiFormHelperText-root">Live voice conversations in the playground. The user's browser connects directly to the provider with a short-lived, single-session secret the server mints; the user's API key never leaves the server.</p></div></div><hr class="MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth css-1ouqunm-MuiDivider-root"><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h6 css-18xxwmt-MuiTypography-root">Hosted tools</h2><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 css-956xpl-MuiTypography-root">Tools the AI provider runs on its side during an answer. Each one reaches outside this deployment and is billed per use by the provider, so every tool is off until you switch it on. The model must also support hosted tools.</p><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-spacing-xs-1 css-1yvsbrk-MuiGrid-root" data-testid="ai-hosted-tools"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-sm-6 css-13xb3fr-MuiGrid-root"><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEnd css-19opgx6-MuiFormControlLabel-root"><span class="MuiSwitch-root MuiSwitch-sizeMedium css-rehya9-MuiSwitch-root"><span class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary PrivateSwitchBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary css-aqlqb4-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiSwitchBase-root-MuiSwitch-switchBase"><input role="switch" aria-label="Web search" class="PrivateSwitchBase-input MuiSwitch-input css-12xagqm-MuiSwitchBase-root" type="checkbox"><span class="MuiSwitch-thumb css-1mw77bv-MuiSwitch-thumb"></span></span><span class="MuiSwitch-track css-pm6g3f-MuiSwitch-track"></span></span><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 MuiFormControlLabel-label css-rizt0-MuiTypography-root">Web search</span></label><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root css-r9aic6-MuiFormHelperText-root">Live web search, with the sources cited in the answer.</p></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-sm-6 css-13xb3fr-MuiGrid-root"><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEnd css-19opgx6-MuiFormControlLabel-root"><span class="MuiSwitch-root MuiSwitch-sizeMedium css-rehya9-MuiSwitch-root"><span class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary PrivateSwitchBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary css-aqlqb4-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiSwitchBase-root-MuiSwitch-switchBase"><input role="switch" aria-label="File search" class="PrivateSwitchBase-input MuiSwitch-input css-12xagqm-MuiSwitchBase-root" type="checkbox"><span class="MuiSwitch-thumb css-1mw77bv-MuiSwitch-thumb"></span></span><span class="MuiSwitch-track css-pm6g3f-MuiSwitch-track"></span></span><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 MuiFormControlLabel-label css-rizt0-MuiTypography-root">File search</span></label><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root css-r9aic6-MuiFormHelperText-root">Search documents in the provider's vector stores.</p></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-sm-6 css-13xb3fr-MuiGrid-root"><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEnd css-19opgx6-MuiFormControlLabel-root"><span class="MuiSwitch-root MuiSwitch-sizeMedium css-rehya9-MuiSwitch-root"><span class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary PrivateSwitchBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary css-aqlqb4-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiSwitchBase-root-MuiSwitch-switchBase"><input role="switch" aria-label="Code interpreter" class="PrivateSwitchBase-input MuiSwitch-input css-12xagqm-MuiSwitchBase-root" type="checkbox"><span class="MuiSwitch-thumb css-1mw77bv-MuiSwitch-thumb"></span></span><span class="MuiSwitch-track css-pm6g3f-MuiSwitch-track"></span></span><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 MuiFormControlLabel-label css-rizt0-MuiTypography-root">Code interpreter</span></label><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root css-r9aic6-MuiFormHelperText-root">Run code in a sandbox the provider manages.</p></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-sm-6 css-13xb3fr-MuiGrid-root"><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEnd css-19opgx6-MuiFormCont