exports[`the AI pages' markup is unchanged > the organization AI keys page 1`] = `"<div class="MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthMd css-1o116p1-MuiContainer-root"><h1 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h4 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1it4a80-MuiTypography-root">Organization AI keys (read-only)</h1><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-9ebprp-MuiTypography-root">Set your organization's own AI provider keys and see its effective AI policy.</p><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation0 MuiAlert-root MuiAlert-colorInfo MuiAlert-standard css-dws3yv-MuiPaper-root-MuiAlert-root" role="alert" style="--Paper-shadow: none;"><div class="MuiAlert-icon css-vab54s-MuiAlert-icon"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeInherit css-1ckov0h-MuiSvgIcon-root" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="InfoOutlinedIcon"><path d="M11,9H13V7H11M12,20C7.59,20 4,16.41 4,12C4,7.59 7.59,4 12,4C16.41,4 20,7.59 20, 12C20,16.41 16.41,20 12,20M12,2A10,10 0 0,0 2,12A10,10 0 0,0 12,22A10,10 0 0,0 22,12A10, 10 0 0,0 12,2M11,17H13V11H11V17Z"></path></svg></div><div class="MuiAlert-message css-zioonp-MuiAlert-message">A key set here pays for your organization's AI calls (a member's own key still comes first). In a single-organization deployment, the deployment key on the AI settings page (/admin/settings/ai) applies unless an organization key is set here.</div></div><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-outlined MuiPaper-rounded css-3jfxuj-MuiPaper-root"><div class="MuiBox-root css-0"><div class="MuiBox-root css-1sf3xto" data-testid="org-ai-key-openai"><div class="MuiStack-root css-1a9ytni-MuiStack-root"><div class="MuiBox-root css-1fjtzvx"><h6 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-subtitle1 css-1i3tsf3-MuiTypography-root">OpenAI</h6><div class="MuiStack-root css-kdc3n8-MuiStack-root"><div class="MuiChip-root MuiChip-filled MuiChip-sizeSmall MuiChip-colorSuccess css-106f2r9-MuiChip-root"><span class="Mu